Package: form.tools
Title: Neutral Model-Driven Workbook Tools
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr")
Description: Splits structurally validated workbooks by model-defined primary
    and parent keys. Populates matching empty workbook templates while retaining
    their styles and supporting workbook parts. Keeps domain definitions and
    reference data outside the workbook transformation layer.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/form.tools/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.tools
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.tools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: form.model (>= 0.5.1), xml2, zip
Remotes: ultreia-io/form.model@v0.5.1
Suggests: knitr, readxl, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/coverage: covr, xml2
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown, covr, htmltools, xml2
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
